  destinations:
  - destinationName: Apple Orchard
    description: 'Rows of healthy apple trees stretch across the sunny countryside.

      Fresh
      fruit fills the branches while birds sing overhead.

      Explore peaceful
      trails surrounded by nature''s harvest.

      Every puzzle brings a sweet
      new reward.'
    background: {fileID: 7773900953925383654, guid: fec3d463ff984473ebdfdf6940fe45c6, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Barnyard
    description: 'Friendly farm animals roam happily around old wooden barns.

      Country
      roads lead to exciting discoveries hidden across the fields.

      Life here
      moves at a gentle and relaxing pace.

      Adventure grows alongside every
      harvest.'
    background: {fileID: -3820510952427351420, guid: 648a0fbeed77a4e5db42a12626b84a30, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Cornfield
    description: 'Tall corn sways gently beneath the warm afternoon sun.

      Hidden
      pathways weave through endless golden rows.

      Every twist and turn reveals
      another exciting challenge.

      Keep exploring until you uncover every secret.'
    background: {fileID: 5751234951834333940, guid: c9de3736233e3405a9387ae7b783bb57, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Pumpkin
    description: Explore Pumpkin and begin a new adventure.
    background: {fileID: 8585082687678664138, guid: a4a729d5ac5d74813a619ee285d7dd07, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Windmill Road
    description: 'A peaceful country road leads past giant windmills and open fields.

      Fresh
      breezes carry the scent of crops ready for harvest.

      Explore every turn
      to discover hidden treasures.

      The countryside always has another surprise
      waiting.'
    background: {fileID: -4085512550612585903, guid: 00d79de73e1fb4879ab9722ed88b039b, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Vegetable Garden
    description: 'Healthy vegetables grow in colorful rows beneath the warm sunshine.

      Busy
      gardeners keep the fields thriving throughout every season.

      Discover
      hidden paths surrounded by fresh harvests.

      Nature rewards every curious
